# ---------- Tool-generated agent files ----------
# `next dev` regenerates its own CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md inside apps/web on every
# run. They are generic Next.js scaffolding notes and would be confused with
# the repo-root CLAUDE.md, which is this project's actual specification.
apps/web/CLAUDE.md
apps/web/AGENTS.md

